{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"MAT","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"馬太福音","commonName":"馬太福音","title":"馬太福音","order":40,"numberOfChapters":28,"sha256":"91a01a9d2852a1096cdedbf305ffd3780f39083c509861f515306fc3cd56733a","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/MAT/1.json","lastChapterNumber":28,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/MAT/28.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1069},"chapter":{"number":28,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶穌復活"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["安息日將盡，七日的頭一日，天快亮的時候，抹大拉的馬利亞和那個馬利亞來看墳墓。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["忽然，地大震動；因為有主的使者從天上下來，把石頭滾開，坐在上面。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他的相貌如同閃電，衣服潔白如雪。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["看守的人就因他嚇得渾身亂戰，甚至和死人一樣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["天使對婦女說：「不要害怕！我知道你們是尋找那釘十字架的耶穌。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["他不在這裏，照他所說的，已經復活了。你們來看安放主的地方。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["快去告訴他的門徒，說他從死裏復活了，並且在你們以先往加利利去，在那裏你們要見他。看哪，我已經告訴你們了。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["婦女們就急忙離開墳墓，又害怕，又大大地歡喜，跑去要報給他的門徒。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["忽然，耶穌遇見她們，說：「願你們平安！」她們就上前抱住他的腳拜他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["耶穌對她們說：「不要害怕！你們去告訴我的弟兄，叫他們往加利利去，在那裏必見我。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["看守的兵報告祭司長"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["她們去的時候，看守的兵有幾個進城去，將所經歷的事都報給祭司長。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["祭司長和長老聚集商議，就拿許多銀錢給兵丁，說："]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["「你們要這樣說：『夜間我們睡覺的時候，他的門徒來，把他偷去了。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["倘若這話被巡撫聽見，有我們勸他，保你們無事。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["兵丁受了銀錢，就照所囑咐他們的去行。這話就傳說在猶太人中間，直到今日。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["門徒奉差遣"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["十一個門徒往加利利去，到了耶穌約定的山上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["他們見了耶穌就拜他，然而還有人疑惑。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["耶穌進前來，對他們說：「天上地下所有的權柄都賜給我了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["所以，你們要去，使萬民作我的門徒，奉父、子、聖靈的名給他們施洗",{"noteId":37},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["凡我所吩咐你們的，都教訓他們遵守，我就常與你們同在，直到世界的末了。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":37,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：給他們施洗，歸於父、子、聖靈的名","reference":{"chapter":28,"verse":19}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/MAT/28.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/MRK/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/MAT/27.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":20}